[ti:Visitor song]
[ar:nishal21 and visitors]
[00:00.00]Someone stopped by late on a quiet night
[00:04.90]left a single note and went on their way
[00:09.68]I never got their name until the credits
[00:14.52]now it plays here every single day
[00:18.92]I was painting a picture (@nishal21)
[00:22.36]One note at a time
[00:26.60]from people passing through
[00:31.60]a name beside a line
[00:36.36]and part of it is you
[00:45.60]Leave yours and the song gets one beat longer
